Interview Explanation

I built a browser-based chat interface using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and FastAPI. User queries are sent through JavaScript fetch() calls to the FastAPI /ask endpoint. The backend invokes the LangGraph workflow, which routes requests to Search, Database, or Writer agents. The response is returned as JSON and dynamically displayed in the chat window.



